     65  2df9							; Every Game Boy / NES voice lets go now (no soft releases), so nothing
     66  2df9							; sounding depends on the old sound's octave or bass settings. The next
     67  2df9							; voice update plays the held notes again.
     68  2df9				   SoundRelease
     69  2df9					      subroutine
