    165  2eaf
    166  2eaf							; The vibrato, glide and detune the SID uses (FxTick, voices.asm). Each is
    167  2eaf							; the menu's choice: AS SOUND (the sound's), ON (the ADVANCED SOUND values),
    168  2eaf							; OFF. VIBRATO or GLIDE held turns on what's off (the ADVANCED SOUND values;
    169  2eaf							; a held VIBRATO has no delay); TAPE WOBBLE held: a deep slow vibrato, each
    170  2eaf							; voice its own phase; WIDE held: the detune about twice as wide.
    171  2eaf				   FxVars
    172  2eaf					      subroutine
    173  2eaf		       ae 95 c3 	      ldx	soundMode
    174  2eb2							; ---- vibrato
